*> A FILE STATUS item is set by the runtime, not by the program.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT IN-FILE ASSIGN TO "in.dat"
        FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  IN-FILE.
01  IN-REC              PIC X(80).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  IN-STATUS           PIC XX.
    88  IN-OK           VALUE "00".
01  UNSET-STATUS        PIC XX.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN INPUT IN-FILE
    IF NOT IN-OK DISPLAY "OPEN FAILED: " IN-STATUS END-IF
    DISPLAY UNSET-STATUS
    CLOSE IN-FILE
    STOP RUN.
